    <node id="VIPER">
      <data key="d_type">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d_desc">"Viper acknowledges breathing techniques and mentions balance issues, suggesting ongoing learning and practice."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is a trail runner excited about the challenges and excitement of trail running, appreciating new challenges."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is part of a group focused on accountability and motivation, contributing to a positive and supportive environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper favors cucumber and mint for hydration, especially in hot weather, and mentions watermelon and mint."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is a participant expressing enthusiasm for outdoor workouts and hiking, while mentioning concerns about the cost."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper discusses Pilates, Russian twists, and core workouts, emphasizing strength, control, and body awareness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is a gym member who is interested in how yoga balances strength and flexibility training."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is a person who shares their experience with shaking during pull-ups and suggests focusing on grip and tension to reduce shaking."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is an individual actively participating in a group fitness or goal-oriented activity, emphasizing accountability and motivation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is a group member who has noticed increased stamina during workouts and is open to sharing tips on improving endurance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is a participant in the conversation who shares a preference for lemon and ginger in water, and discusses the benefits of ginger for digestion."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is a participant in the conversation who shares hydration strategies, such as keeping a water bottle nearby and drinking after workouts, and discusses flavor additions like lemon."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is a participant in the discussion, sharing stir-fry meal prep ideas and discussing favorite ingredients and sauces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is a person who is looking for ways to mix up their workout routine and has been incorporating weight training and sumo squats into their fitness regimen."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is a person who looks forward to increasing their workout intensity and achieving new personal records."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is a team member who appreciates the role of music in workouts and engages in discussions about preferred genres for motivation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is experimenting with variations of compound movements, such as single-leg squats and decline push-ups, to increase workout intensity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is a fitness enthusiast who uses foam rolling for muscle relief and is interested in incorporating ankle circles and cat-cow stretches into their routine."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is an individual who discusses adding hopping exercises to their warm-up routine and shares thoughts on trying single-leg hops for balance and strength."&lt;SEP&gt;"Viper is a participant in the workout class who prefers a combination of strength training and cardio in their routine."</data>
      <data key="d_deg">10</data>
